# 6. System API

## Get System Status

```
GET /system/status
```

Response

```json
{
  "cpu": "18%",
  "memory": "41%",
  "temperature": "49°C",
  "uptime": "2h 35m"
}
```

---

## Restart System

```
POST /system/restart
```

---

## Shutdown System

```
POST /system/shutdown
```

---

## Get System Information

```
GET /system/info
```

Returns

- Raspberry Pi Model
- OS Version
- Python Version
- Software Version
- IP Address

