# API Summary

The HoloJARVIS API is designed around a modular, versioned REST architecture that enables secure communication between the physical HoloJARVIS device and external clients. It provides endpoints for AI conversations, voice interaction, holographic rendering, computer vision, automation, remote computer management, file operations, plugins, and system administration, while remaining extensible for future capabilities such as AI agents, workflow automation, and IoT integration.
